PPLICATION DEVELOPMENT</div>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Desktop <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Engine <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Offload <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Build <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Build Cloud <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Compose <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Extensions <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Deprecated products and features</a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Release lifecycle</a>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">SUPPLY CHAIN SECURITY</div>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Hardened Images <span class=\"new-badge\">New</span> <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Hub <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker Scout <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">PLATFORM</div>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Support</a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Billing <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Docker accounts <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Security <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Subscription <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Release notes</a>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">ENTERPRISE</div>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Administration <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Deploy Docker Desktop <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Security <span class=\"arrow\">∧</span></a>\n    <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Add and manage domains</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Single sign-on <span class=\"arrow\">∧</span></a>\n      <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n        <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Setup</a>\n        <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Manage connections</a>\n        <a class=\"nav-item active\" href=\"#\">Troubleshoot</a>\n        <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">FAQs <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Provision <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Enforce sign-in <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Roles and permissions <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n      <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Hardened Docker Desktop <span class=\"arrow\">∨</span></a>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"nav-item\" href=\"#\">Organization access tokens</a>\n  </aside>\n\n  <main class=\"main-content\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Home</a> <span>/</span> <a href=\"#\">Manuals</a> <span>/</span> <a href=\"#\">Security</a> <span>/</span> <a href=\"#\">Single sign-on</a> <span>/</span> Troubleshoot\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>Troubleshoot single sign-on</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"action-bar\">\n      <a href=\"#\">🤖 Ask Gordon</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">📋 Copy Markdown</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">🔗 View Markdown</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>This page describes common single sign-on (SSO) errors and their solutions. Issues can stem from your identity provider (IdP) configuration or Docker settings.</p>\n\n    <h2>Check for errors</h2>\n    <p>If you experience SSO issues, check both Docker and your identity provider for errors first.</p>\n\n    <h2>Check Docker error logs</h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Sign in to <a href=\"#\">Docker Home</a> and select your organization from the top-left account drop-down.</li>\n      <li>Select <strong>Admin Console</strong>, then <strong>SSO and SCIM</strong>.</li>\n      <li>In the SSO connections table, select the <strong>Action</strong> menu and then <strong>View error logs</strong>.</li>\n      <li>For more details on specific errors, select <strong>View error details</strong> next to an error message.</li>\n      <li>Note any errors you see on this page for further troubleshooting.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h2>Check identity provider errors</h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Review your IdP's logs or audit trails for any failed authentication or provisioning attempts.</li>\n      <li>Confirm that your IdP's SSO settings match the values provided in Docker.</li>\n      <li>If applicable, confirm that you have configured user provisioning correctly and that it is enabled in your IdP.</li>\n      <li>If applicable, verify that your IdP correctly maps Docker's required user attributes.</li>\n      <li>Try provisioning a test user from your IdP and verify if they appear in Docker.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p>For further troubleshooting, check your IdP's documentation or contact their support team.</p>\n\n    <h2>Groups are not formatted correctly</h2>\n\n    <h3>Error message</h3>\n    <p>When this issue occurs, the following error message is common:</p>\n    <div class=\"code-block\">Some of the groups assigned to the user are not formatted as '&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;'</div>\n\n    <h3>Causes</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Incorrect group name formatting in your identity provider (IdP): Docker requires groups to follow the format <code>&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;</code>. If the groups assigned to a user do not follow this format, they will be ignored.</li>\n      <li>Non-matching groups between IdP and Docker organization: If a group in your IdP does not have a corresponding team in Docker, it will not be recognized, and the user will be placed in the default organization and team.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Affected environments</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Docker single sign-on setup using IdPs such as Okta or Azure AD</li>\n    </ul>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside class=\"sidebar-right\">\n    <a class=\"action-link\" href=\"#\">✏️ Edit this page</a>\n    <a class=\"action-link\" href=\"#\">🚩 Request changes</a>\n\n    <div class=\"toc-title\">Table of contents</div>\n    <ul class=\"toc-list\">\n      <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"active\">Check for errors</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Groups are not formatted correctly</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">User is not assigned to the organization</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">IdP-initiated sign in is not enabled for connection</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Not enough seats in organization</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Domain is not verified for SSO connection</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Unable to find session</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Name ID is not an email address</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n\n<button class=\"feedback-btn\">😊 Give feedback</button>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
